{
 "text": "Ye jo aap video dekh rahe ho na ye mere studio mein kisi bhi editor ne edit nahi kari hai ye poori ki poori AI se edit hui hai ab main bolun isko ki bhai mere ko upar top left corner mein le ja aur neeche ki taraf laga de meri poori reel Aur dikhaye usmein badhiya badhiya graphics uske alawa main agar aage aa jaun mere peeche aa jaaye text aur us text ka font thoda cinematic lagna chahiye wo bhi ye kar deta hai uske alawa main bolun ki mere haath mein jo products hain isko highlight kar de aur uske baad isme se kuch graphics nikaale meri ghadi mein se aur phir us graphics ko wapas le jaaye Aur iske baad main bolun ki mera bana de paper cut effect aur mujhe ek side mein le jaake meri screen par saare mere ek product ke B-roll laga de aur uske baad finally main aaun aur bolun bhai saab bye Ab ye sab kuch aap bhi kar sakte ho bahut aasaan hai Aapko apne Claude ko ek video editor ki tarah convert karna hai Ab iski ek bana rakhi maine poori guide aap comment kar do EDIT main aapke DM mein bhej dunga follow kar lena warna DM nahi jaayega Aur bhai aap apni editing ghar baithe karwa sakte Ab obviously AI hai to kharcha to lagega ab editor se zyada lagega ya kam Wo main bataunga uske liye follow kar lena",
